Natas Level 11: XOR Encryption Bypass
What You See
A page with a background color picker
Message: "Cookies are protected with XOR encryption"
Source code reveals cookie handling logic
The Vulnerability
XOR encryption with a reused key is vulnerable to known-plaintext attacks.
php
function xor_encrypt($in) {
    $key = '<censored>';  // Hidden but reused
    $outText = '';
    for($i=0; $i<strlen($text); $i++) {
        $outText .= $text[$i] ^ $key[$i % strlen($key)];
    }
    return $outText;
}
